  1612). hardware_attempt_counts 20 to 21 (attempt 28, serving, charged; attempt
  29, measurement, uncounted). Off-graph seats in the window: the PR 6 reviewer
  and rebase seats (section 1 routes them), and 18 reviewer seats per launcher or
