  lead-invented and the lead answers as the user's own serving-pair gate (DECISIONS
  1059) - no graph line asks for them and this revision adds none. Last write
  report: 36 declared outcomes, 212,271,796 bytes, 5,896,439 bytes per outcome,
  down 1.5-fold.

